 "note": "v1.6 solver fix (Sherman, Steiner, BPF SVF limiter), Sherman partial self-oscillation (damping floor + resonance limiter), Ladder HP replaced by the Moog 904B (dwg. 1118, no resonance), BPF SEM/Steiner (SVF) and MS-20 (CASCADE) on the LPF engine circuit cores, BPF ARP 2600 on the 4012 core (Board 3 law; 4072 roll-off removed: the documented 2600 is a 4012 unit), LPF 07 rail in stage units, VCA THRUST MED/LOUD rebuilt to the US 5,170,437 Fig. 4 circuit cited by the API 2500 manual (MED half), VCA AUTO make-up pivots on +4 dBu (API 2500 manual) (every BPF render also carries the start-up fade from the default SEM-SVF slot), Ladder on the Minimoog filter board (Emphasis law, C5/C1/C10 couplings, gain-recovery pair; also the power-on fade from the default Ladder) and Reference-mode power-on default; legacy tests run in Creative mode (tests/dsp.py base)"
